WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.100
Standing heavy punch connects and cancels into Drive Rush.

2
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.100
Forward heavy links from the Rush.

3
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.100
Standing medium punch begins the target-combo sequence.

4
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:03.600
The back-heavy and heavy target follow-ups juggle Ryu.

5
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.100
Sakkai Fuhazan activates from the last target-combo hit.

6
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:09.150
The Level 1 juggle completes the conversion.
